From 5f0f104a311231d84916f659a475d52916b5d7a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:41:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Match icons across breakpoints, fix bag icon shape,
 homepage layout
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Bag and menu icons now identical on desktop and mobile: same
  even-line hamburger, same shopping-bag icon (the previous tote-with-
  loop-handle read as a bucket/trash can at icon size, even in its
  original larger form — swapped for the standard folded-top bag glyph)
- Homepage "Latest Drop": floral illustration is now a decorative
  backdrop behind the section, not painted onto the hero-image
  placeholder itself; eyebrow/title/subtitle left-aligned, hero image
  and buttons stay centred. Same backdrop treatment applied to the
  product page's hero image for consistency.
- Add to Bag is now black (btn-filled--black) instead of the accent
  colour, on both the homepage reveal and the product page

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012WaFXB7ZStPCrgjGNusLz5
